#: main.cpp:36
msgid "Install, list, remove Plasma packages"
msgstr "Plasmapaketen installeren, oplisten un wegmaken"

#: main.cpp:47
msgid "Plasma Package Manager"
msgstr "Pleger för Plasma-Paketen"

#: main.cpp:49
msgid "(C) 2008, Aaron Seigo"
msgstr "(C) 2008, Aaron Seigo"

#: main.cpp:50
msgid "Aaron Seigo"
msgstr "Aaron Seigo"

#: main.cpp:51
msgid "Original author"
msgstr "Orginaalautor"

#: main.cpp:60
msgid "For install or remove, operates on packages installed for all users."
msgstr ""
"Bi't Installeren un Wegmaken gellt dat för Paketen, de för all Brukers "
"installeert sünd"

#: main.cpp:63
msgid ""
"The type of package, e.g. theme, wallpaper, plasmoid, DataEngine, Runner, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"De Typ vun't Paket, a.B. Muster, Achtergrundbild, Plasmoid, Datenkarn, "
"Dreger usw."

#: main.cpp:67
msgid "Install the package at <path>"
msgstr "Dat Paket ünner den Padd <path> installeren"

#: main.cpp:69
msgid "List installed packages"
msgstr "Installeert Paketen oplisten"

#: main.cpp:71
msgid "Remove the package named <name>"
msgstr "Dat Paket mit den Naam <name> wegmaken"

#: main.cpp:73
msgid ""
"Absolute path to the package root. If not supplied, then the standard data "
"directories for this KDE session will be searched instead."
msgstr ""
"Afsoluut Padd na de Paketwörtel. Wenn nich angeven, warrt de Standard-"
"Datenornern för dissen KDE-Törn dörkeken."

#: main.cpp:92
msgid "plasmoid"
msgstr "plasmoid"

#: main.cpp:95
msgid "theme"
msgstr "theme"

#: main.cpp:97
msgid "wallpaper"
msgstr "wallpaper"

#: main.cpp:99
msgid "dataengine"
msgstr "dataengine"

#: main.cpp:102
msgid "runner"
msgstr "runner"

#: main.cpp:113
msgid "Could not find a suitable installer for package of type"
msgstr "Keen passen Installeerprogramm funnen för Pakettyp"

#: main.cpp:121
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not load installer for package of type %1. Error reported was: %2"
msgstr ""
"Dat Installeerprogramm för den Pakettyp \"%1\" lett sik nich laden. De "
"torüchgeven Fehler weer: %2"

#: main.cpp:155
msgid "One of install, remove or list is required."
msgstr "Du muttst wat installeren, wegmaken oder oplisten."

